# QPulse Core

## Monorepo map

- `apps/mobile` — Expo SDK 55, expo-router
- `apps/api` — NestJS 11, Prisma, WS, BullMQ
- `apps/admin` — Next.js 16, Tailwind v4
- `packages/shared` — DTOs, enums, WS payloads (**source of truth**)

## Stack (stable/LTS only)

- Node 24.16.0, PostgreSQL 18, Redis 7
- No beta deps (NestJS 12, Expo SDK 56, etc.)

## Forbidden

- External market APIs in mobile/admin (exception: `apps/api/src/market-metrics` only)
- Mock JSON files in Phase 1 — use Prisma + seed
- Duplicating types outside `packages/shared`
- Hardcoding menu items in mobile — use `MenuLink`
- Push token via WebSocket — only `POST /devices/register`
- Showing CANCELLED signals in mobile

## Signal rules

- Statuses: OPEN, ACTIVE, CLOSED, CANCELLED
- `liquidated` only when CLOSED; forces `slHit=false`
- Results: closed signals by `closeDate` + timeframe window
- Admin CRUD only path for signal management

## Before coding

Read `tasks.md`, `AGENTS.md`, relevant `docs/contracts/*`.

## When done

Update `tasks.md`, docs if contracts changed, run `pnpm lint && pnpm typecheck`.
